{"id":17877,"name":"Marshall County","slug":"marshall-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/marshall-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Bid Down","redemptionPeriod":"3 years","interestRate":"Up to 8%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"May"},{"label":"Number of Liens","value":"604 liens (totaling $532,374.32)"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Michael Johnson, Revenue Commissioner"},{"label":"Contact Info","value":"256-571-7743, commission@marshallco.org"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Marshall County Courthouse, Guntersville"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Marshall County Online"},{"label":"Treasurer’s Office","value":"Marshall County Revenue"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"ENRqdBLenPjoC8aO21X5lHk7ygUSiI9V3p4ztArMGQTbWm\"><iframe title=\"Maximize Your Gains Up to 8% - Marshall County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OHUreQqoRSc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Maximize-Your-Gains-Up-to-8%---Marshall-County---Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Maximize Your Gains Up to 8% &#8211; Marshall County &#8211; Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Earn up to 8% interest at Marshall County&#8217;s Tax Lien Sale in May. It&#8217;s a chance to grow your investment, not just buy property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Picture being in the courthouse with other investors as more than 500 tax liens worth over half a million dollars are available for you to buy. This is your opportunity to dive into the competitive world of tax lien sales, where your strategic bidding could lock in a lucrative 8% interest rate.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s all happening live, in person, at the Marshall County Courthouse. Just show up, sign up, and get ready to make your move.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The auction uses the bid-down method, which is from 8% to going down. Each bid could lead to owning property or earning interest if it&#8217;s not redeemed in three years.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Need more info? Visit the Treasurer&#8217;s office to check on the lowdown on properties.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marshall-County-Courthouse-in-Guntersville-Alabama-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17880 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Marshall County Courthouse in Guntersville Alabama\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework</strong>: Research the property and its value. Verify the legal description and any existing claims or judgments.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand Local Laws</strong>: Familiarize yourself with Alabama&#8217;s tax lien laws to ensure compliance and optimize your investment strategy.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Treasurer&#8217;s Office</strong>: Get firsthand information about the properties and the auction process.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare for Competition</strong>: The auction is competitive, so have a clear strategy and maximum bid amount in mind.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Attractions-and-Economic-Highlights\">Attractions and Economic Highlights</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Popular-Attractions\">Popular Attractions</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Parks</strong>: Enjoy the natural beauty of Lake Guntersville State Park.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Theatres and Museums</strong>: Visit the Guntersville Museum and Cultural Center.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Historic Sites</strong>: Explore the rich history of the Marshall County Courthouse.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Transportation-Infrastructure\">Transportation Infrastructure</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Roads</strong>: Convenient access via US Highways 431 and 75.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rails</strong>: Nearby rail services for easy freight transport.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Airports</strong>: Huntsville International Airport is just an hour&#8217;s drive away.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Economic-Development\">Economic Development</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Growth Sectors</strong>: Agriculture, manufacturing, and eco-tourism are thriving in Marshall County.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Community-Appeal\">Community Appeal</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Outdoor Activities</strong>: Fishing, boating, and hiking in numerous parks and lakes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Entertainment</strong>: Local festivals, live music, and community events.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Historical Attractions</strong>: Numerous historical markers and sites to explore.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q1: What is a tax lien certificate?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: It&#8217;s a claim against a property for unpaid property taxes. As an investor, you pay the taxes and in return, earn interest on the amount paid.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q2: What happens if the property owner doesn&#8217;t pay back the taxes?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You may eventually foreclose on the property, depending on local laws.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q3: How do I participate in the Marshall County Tax Lien Sale?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Attend the live auction at the courthouse, register as a bidder, and start bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.marshallco.org/departments/revenue/revenue.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Marshall County Revenue</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.marshallco.org/index2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Marshall County Online</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bid4assets.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bid4Assets</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-